  "description": "Command-line file encryption built on PostQuantum.FileEncryption: `pqfe encrypt` / `pqfe decrypt` for the FROZEN .pqfe v2 container format. Authenticated AES-256-GCM with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 or Argon2id passphrase derivation, atomic output files, fail-closed decryption (wrong passphrase and tampered ciphertext are indistinguishable errors), and sysexits.h exit codes for scripting. Passphrases come from a no-echo prompt or an environment variable for CI use. Install: dotnet tool install -g PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Tool. Requires the .NET 10 runtime or later.",
