  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — first published release of the pqfe command-line tool, packaged from the same source tree, release workflow, and supply-chain pipeline (SBOM, SLSA-style provenance attestation, deterministic build) as PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.1.0. Bundles the library; the .pqfe v2 container format is FROZEN for the 1.x line.",
